{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S08、S11等短段的文字和感受仍然偏密，留给观众边听边扫的余裕不足；个别地方还把人物动机解释得比X更确定。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段最重要的信息，观众不必逐字读完，就能迅速抓住叙事落点；话语拆分后的因果关系也更容易跟上。感受按音乐段落出现，且有更具体的身体反应、情绪变化和声音质感，不只是罗列情绪名称，因此人物从怀念、动摇、孤独到重新决定生活的过程更容易被听见和理解。虽然个别短段略显拥挤，但整体上Y更适合一边听钢琴曲一边观看。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9f8bd297-0e9f-4b44-901a-60d6d596c1b2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T210031501839Z", "elapsed_seconds": 52.953, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:01:24.466490+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "35f2ae078cdff3e670d4df5cdf0d14866842286b1318725f31d3c3602c05d589", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "ee